{
  "schema_version": "report-evidence/1",
  "source_sha256": "7461bcf7d86239659e541f20b39d7038f73ddc3bb2f2100eff8a1a43ea5b91d0",
  "fragments": [
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0001",
      "text": "Exercise Cost Manipulation via Atomic Price Deviation Enables Value Extraction",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 78,
      "line": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0002",
      "text": "## Vulnerability details",
      "start": 80,
      "end": 104,
      "line": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0003",
      "text": "The `exerciseCost()` function in `RiskEngine.sol` calculates exercise fees using `currentTick` (spot price) for value computation while the staleness check only ensures deviation from TWAP is under 513 ticks (~5%). An attacker can atomically manipulate the pool price by up to 512 ticks to extract value from position holders during force exercise operations.",
      "start": 106,
      "end": 465,
      "line": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0004",
      "text": "### Root Cause",
      "start": 467,
      "end": 481,
      "line": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0005",
      "text": "The staleness threshold is defined in RiskEngine.sol:76:",
      "start": 483,
      "end": 539,
      "line": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0006",
      "text": "Value is calculated using currentTick (manipulable spot) in RiskEngine.sol:450-458:",
      "start": 541,
      "end": 624,
      "line": 11
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0007",
      "text": "Exercise fees are based on the difference in RiskEngine.sol:467-472:",
      "start": 626,
      "end": 694,
      "line": 13
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0008",
      "text": "### Attack Scenario",
      "start": 696,
      "end": 715,
      "line": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0009",
      "text": "1. Attacker identifies a long ITM position eligible for force exercise",
      "start": 717,
      "end": 787,
      "line": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0010",
      "text": "2. In a single atomic transaction:",
      "start": 788,
      "end": 822,
      "line": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0011",
      "text": "- Flash loan large amount of Token0",
      "start": 826,
      "end": 861,
      "line": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0012",
      "text": "- Swap to push currentTick DOWN by 512 ticks (just under 513 limit)",
      "start": 865,
      "end": 932,
      "line": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0013",
      "text": "- Call forceExercise() - position is exercised at manipulated price",
      "start": 936,
      "end": 1003,
      "line": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0014",
      "text": "- Position holder receives ~5% less value than fair price",
      "start": 1007,
      "end": 1064,
      "line": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0015",
      "text": "- Swap back to original price",
      "start": 1068,
      "end": 1097,
      "line": 23
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0016",
      "text": "- Repay flash loan",
      "start": 1101,
      "end": 1119,
      "line": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0017",
      "text": "3. Net profit: ~4.43% of position value",
      "start": 1120,
      "end": 1159,
      "line": 25
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0018",
      "text": "### Impact",
      "start": 1161,
      "end": 1171,
      "line": 27
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0019",
      "text": "**HIGH** - Direct theft of funds from position holders:",
      "start": 1173,
      "end": 1228,
      "line": 29
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0020",
      "text": "| Component              | Value              |",
      "start": 1230,
      "end": 1277,
      "line": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0021",
      "text": "|------------------------|--------------------|",
      "start": 1278,
      "end": 1325,
      "line": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0022",
      "text": "| Position Value         | $100,000           |",
      "start": 1326,
      "end": 1373,
      "line": 33
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0023",
      "text": "| Max Manipulation       | 512 ticks (~5.12%) |",
      "start": 1374,
      "end": 1421,
      "line": 34
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0024",
      "text": "| Value Extracted        | $5,120             |",
      "start": 1422,
      "end": 1469,
      "line": 35
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0025",
      "text": "| Flash Loan Fee (0.09%) | $90                |",
      "start": 1470,
      "end": 1517,
      "line": 36
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0026",
      "text": "| Swap Fees (0.6% x2)    | $600               |",
      "start": 1518,
      "end": 1565,
      "line": 37
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0027",
      "text": "| **Net Profit**         | **$4,430**         |",
      "start": 1566,
      "end": 1613,
      "line": 38
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0028",
      "text": "Attack is profitable for any position over ~$25,000 in value. This is atomic manipulation within a single transaction, which is explicitly IN SCOPE per contest rules.",
      "start": 1615,
      "end": 1781,
      "line": 40
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0029",
      "text": "## Recommended Mitigation",
      "start": 1784,
      "end": 1809,
      "line": 42
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0030",
      "text": "### Option 1: Use oracle price for exercise settlement (Recommended)",
      "start": 1811,
      "end": 1879,
      "line": 44
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0031",
      "text": "### Option 2: Reduce manipulation threshold",
      "start": 1882,
      "end": 1925,
      "line": 47
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0032",
      "text": "Lower `MAX_TWAP_DELTA_LIQUIDATION` to make attacks unprofitable:",
      "start": 1927,
      "end": 1991,
      "line": 49
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0033",
      "text": "At 100 ticks (~1%), attack profit drops to ~0.3% which is below typical costs.",
      "start": 1994,
      "end": 2072,
      "line": 52
    },
    {
      "id": "e_7461bcf7d862_0034",
      "text": "### Option 3: Add manipulation-resistant price bounds",
      "start": 2074,
      "end": 2127,
      "line": 54
    }
  ]
}
